### debt.summary — resumo do débito (leitura)
POST https://alteapay.com/api/webhooks/n8n
Content-Type: application/json
x-alteapay-signature: <HMAC_HEX>
x-alteapay-timestamp: <EPOCH_SEGUNDOS>

{ "action": "debt.summary", "session_id": "<UUID_SESSAO>" }

### Resposta esperada
# 200 { "success": true, "summary": { "creditorName": "...", "originalValue": <reais>, "agingDays": 557, "oldestDueDate": "2025-03-10", "invoices": [ ... ] } }
